Package: localpsidR
Type: Package
Title: Build Panel Data Sets from PSID Raw Data
Version: 2.3
Date: 2024-11-05
Authors@R: c(
    person("Juan", "González Hijón", role = c("cre", "aut"),
           email = "jgonzhijon@gmail.com"),
    person("Florian", "Oswald", role = "aut",
           email = "florian.oswald@gmail.com"))
Description: Merges Panel Study of Income Dynamics (PSID) family and
    individual files into a wide-format panel data set. The user obtains the
    files from the PSID data center; the package does not download data and
    does not handle credentials. Files are imported once with getPSID(),
    which uses the 'SAScii' package to read the SAS layout files, and the
    panel is built with build.panel(). It is a fork of 'psidR' by Florian
    Oswald.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
